      "score": 1,
      "explanation": "The sense of being unsafe leads to scanning, watching the doors and corners, staying busy, and not feeling anything.",
      "quote": "[\"something bad will catch me off guard\", \"it feels like the only way to stay safe\", \"stopping feels unsafe\", \"i just want to stay busy and not feel anything bc the fear gets louder when i stop\"]"
    }
  }
}
